1
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:12,260
I am pleased to share my views on China’s express delivery industry, which has grown remarkably in recent years and has changed the way people live.
我很高兴谈谈我对中国快递业的看法，这个行业近年来发展显著，改变了人们的生活方式。

2
00:00:13,060 --> 00:00:17,310
The industry has expanded rapidly and improved greatly in quality.
这个行业迅速扩张，质量也大大提高。

3
00:00:18,110 --> 00:00:23,520
Delivery networks now reach not only big cities but also many small towns and villages.
如今，配送网络不仅覆盖大城市，还延伸到许多小城镇和乡村。

4
00:00:24,320 --> 00:00:31,630
Packages that once took a week to arrive are often delivered within a day or two, and customers can track them on their phones.
过去要一周才能送到的包裹，如今往往一两天之内就能送达，顾客还可以用手机追踪包裹。

5
00:00:32,430 --> 00:00:41,240
Meanwhile, automated sorting centers, smart lockers and, in some areas, delivery drones have made deliveries faster and pickups easier.
与此同时，自动化分拣中心、智能快递柜，以及一些地区的送货无人机，让送货更快，取件更方便。

6
00:00:42,040 --> 00:00:45,400
These changes have made people’s lives far more convenient.
这些变化让人们的生活便利多了。

7
00:00:46,200 --> 00:00:52,310
Online shopping has become easy and affordable, so people can buy almost anything without leaving home.
网购变得方便又实惠，人们几乎足不出户就能买到任何东西。

8
00:00:53,110 --> 00:00:59,550
Farmers in remote areas can now sell fresh fruit to customers across the country and raise their incomes.
如今，偏远地区的农民可以把新鲜水果卖给全国各地的顾客，提高自己的收入。

9
00:01:00,350 --> 00:01:02,890
The industry has also created many jobs.
这个行业还创造了许多就业岗位。

10
00:01:03,690 --> 00:01:13,260
However, the growing number of packages produces a huge amount of packaging waste, so companies and consumers should work together to promote recyclable packaging.
然而，日益增多的包裹产生了大量包装垃圾，所以企业和消费者应该共同努力，推广可回收包装。

11
00:01:14,060 --> 00:01:17,590
Overall, the impact of the industry has been highly positive.
总的来说，这个行业的影响是非常积极的。
